  "spokenCues": [
    {
      "id": "40.01",
      "text": "This time we know the probability, not the cutoff. The seventy-fifth percentile has zero point seven five of the area to its left."
    },
    {
      "id": "40.02",
      "text": "On a Calculator page, press Menu. Choose Probability, then Distributions, then Inverse Normal."
    },
    {
      "id": "40.03",
      "text": "In Area, enter zero point seven five. Enter fifty for the mean and eight for the standard deviation."
    },
    {
      "id": "40.04",
      "text": "Confirm. Press Enter again to calculate. The cutoff is about fifty-five point four, above the mean of fifty."
    },
    {
      "id": "40.05",
      "text": "For the top ten percent, zero point one is on the right. Subtract from one: zero point nine is on the left."
    },
    {
      "id": "40.06",
      "text": "Open Menu, Probability, Distributions, and Inverse Normal again. Enter zero point nine for Area. Keep fifty for the mean and eight for the standard deviation."
    },
    {
      "id": "40.07",
      "text": "Confirm, then press Enter again. The cutoff is about sixty point three, in the original measurement units."
    }
  ],
